     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "らしい introduces an inference or information from others; the nuance depends on the evidence and context.",
     "texto": [
      "It usually follows a plain form. Don't always translate it as hearsay: it can be a conclusion based on clues, similar to «it looks like».",
